  "certified_type": {
    "category": "Automatic catchweigher",
    "type_designations": ["LI-700", "CWL-700"],
    "module_designation": null,
    "description": "Automatic catchweigher operating as an automatic weight or weight/price labeller (Category Y) under the designation LI-700, and designated CWL-700 when configured to operate only as an automatic checkweigher (Category X). Comprises a self-indicating and price-computing weighing machine with associated thermal label printer and mechanical handling facilities, designed to weigh packs statically at a constant rate of operation. Provided with initial zero-setting device (≤ 4% of Max), semi-automatic zero-setting device, automatic zero-setting after time interval (≤ 15 min) or number of packs, zero-tracking device, preset tare device, semi-automatic subtractive tare device, zero indication, calibration not accessible to user, and price computation. Interfaces: USB, serial (RS232), Ethernet."
